{"task_id": "HumanEval/35", "solution": "```python\ndef max_element(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return the maximum element in the list. Returns None if the list is empty.\n    >>> max_element([1, 2, 3])\n    3\n    >>> max_element([5, 3, -5, 2, -3, 3, 9, 0, 123, 1, -10])\n    123\n    >>> max_element([]) is None\n    True\n    \"\"\"\n    if not l:\n        return None\n\n    current_max = l[0]\n    for element in l[1:]:\n        if element > current_max:\n            current_max = element\n    return current_max\n```"}
